  'hearing test' => 'An audiologic assessment that measures hearing thresholds and speech perception across frequencies to identify conductive, sensorineural, or mixed hearing loss.',
  "Heberden's node" => 'A hard, bony enlargement of the distal interphalangeal joint caused by osteoarthritis, usually affecting the fingers and sometimes producing pain, stiffness, or reduced dexterity.',
