  'hemorrhoidal hemorrhage' => 'Rectal bleeding from enlarged or injured hemorrhoidal vessels, usually bright red and associated with defecation; heavy, persistent, painful, or unexplained bleeding requires evaluation for other causes.',
  'heparan sulfate' => 'A sulfated glycosaminoglycan in cell surfaces and extracellular matrix that binds growth factors, regulates signaling, and contributes to filtration-barrier and connective-tissue structure.',
