  'hardness' => 'A measurable resistance to deformation, used in medicine and materials science; in clinical contexts it may describe tissue induration, a hard mass, or hard stool depending on the setting.',
  'health care' => 'The prevention, diagnosis, treatment, and ongoing support provided to maintain or improve health, delivered by professionals, institutions, public-health systems, and informal caregivers.',
  'health care facility' => 'A place where health services are delivered, such as a clinic, hospital, laboratory, nursing facility, or rehabilitation center; its services and level of care determine appropriate referrals.',
